# A1 — the SDK build schema REQUIRES scopeId, and a scope sys_id is instance-local.
# now.config.json is therefore GENERATED from now.config.template.json and carries
# the resolved id; the template is the tracked source of truth. Untracked so no
# commit timing can ever capture the pin (it captured one once).
